I built the workflow from the brief and saved it under slot w3-A2. I haven't tested the payment conversation yet: the only live check was one chat turn. The agent answered "Hello?" with the correct opening (digital assistant from Freya Bank, call recorded, "Am I speaking with Ms Lee?"), so the workflow starts. As instructed, I didn't run any practice cases.

